 from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Di9bDQ6pdPIQ7kNvwEfkw6m&_nc_oc=Adr4OaIhsLsjIrl49jHlzZ4DlwG06VgChq-iCkSEqZlUeJjoZnzwwMQ5cDrLRKCUxO8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQO6FJLdH5Ft7Y_UNEdoPKWveLK-ZraW73NxLlxVx08cgg&oe=6AD24041"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FKl95go6wTsQ7kNvwFEp0YX&_nc_oc=AdqCIDQf177A_XIb_OxN3S0qg_YwmScVMBrd-gh_7xnv5XzPR0uCZ2Nb-ShC1GpKhd0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMliC4ukOhyuk6ek87XFGZMT2qhnl8vwGv6qyMGNkW2Dw&oe=6AD24DA6"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7pdp3CEFfIwQ7kNvwFcHdjm&_nc_oc=AdoEUIVzIEHmbZVIW_4KDG7gsStetuQuP0ULFZPM5Xt1xF8-9QFifr0KQVHt4SHtsCQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPGG39nlhlYOHpPnvEuS5BJ7xvUGA40SweacfLK7kiF0g&oe=6AD2579C"}, {"fil